<BaseLayout title="About Deskutil — Independent Free Browser Tools" description={description} canonical="https://deskutil.com/about/">
<article class="shell page-heading prose">
<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
<h1>Independent tools that stay on your device.</h1>
<p>Deskutil is an independent site of free browser tools, run by Juan. It is not a company page, a funded product, or a tax or legal practice—just a small collection of utilities people actually search for.</p>
<h2>What you get</h2>
<p>Every tool is a focused utility that runs in your browser. There are no accounts, no uploads, and no backend that receives what you paste or type. Inputs stay on your device; you can close the tab and the numbers leave with it.</p>
<h2>Why it exists</h2>
<p>The useful stuff is often boring: format JSON, generate a UUID, or split GST on an invoice. Deskutil is for those jobs, especially calculators that show up in everyday searches, without sign-up walls or extra chrome.</p>
<p>Start on the <a href="/">homepage</a>, browse the <a href="/finance/">Finance</a> hub, or open the <a href="/finance/gst-calculator/">GST calculator</a>. Questions about the site go to <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>. How inputs are handled is on the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> page.</p>
</article>
</BaseLayout>
